<section class="activity-panel teleport-panel" id="page-teleport" hidden>
  <header class="activity-panel-heading teleport-heading">
    <p class="overline"><span></span> TELEPORT MAP</p>
    <h2>传送</h2>
    <p>从地图选择授权目标，传送角色或实时载具。</p>
  </header>
  <div class="teleport-workspace">
    <section class="teleport-map-panel" aria-label="SCUM 传送地图">
      <div class="teleport-layer-toolbar" aria-label="地图图层">
        <label class="teleport-layer-vehicle"><input id="teleportLayerVehicles" type="checkbox" checked><span data-teleport-icon="vehicle" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>本人/队友载具</span></label>
        <label class="teleport-layer-player unavailable"><input id="teleportLayerPlayer" type="checkbox" checked disabled><span data-teleport-icon="player" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>本人角色</span></label>
        <label class="teleport-layer-teammate unavailable"><input id="teleportLayerTeammates" type="checkbox" checked disabled><span data-teleport-icon="teammate" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>小队队友</span></label>
        <label class="teleport-layer-flag unavailable"><input id="teleportLayerFlags" type="checkbox" checked disabled><span data-teleport-icon="flag" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>本人/小队领地旗</span></label>
        <label class="teleport-layer-fixed unavailable"><input id="teleportLayerFixedLocations" type="checkbox" checked disabled><span data-teleport-icon="fixed" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>固定位置</span></label>
        <label><input id="teleportLayerGrid" type="checkbox" checked> <span>地图网格</span></label>
        <button class="button ghost" id="teleportMapRefresh" type="button">刷新位置</button>
      </div>
      <div class="teleport-map-toolbar" aria-label="地图缩放控制" aria-hidden="true" hidden>
        <button class="button ghost" id="teleportZoomOut" type="button" aria-label="缩小地图">−</button>
        <label><span>缩放</span><input id="teleportZoomRange" type="range" min="100" max="800" step="25" value="100" aria-label="地图缩放比例"></label>
        <strong id="teleportZoomValue">100%</strong>
        <button class="button ghost" id="teleportZoomIn" type="button" aria-label="放大地图">+</button>
        <button class="button ghost" id="teleportZoomReset" type="button">复位</button>
      </div>
      <div class="teleport-map-frame" id="teleportMapFrame">
        <div class="teleport-map-canvas" id="teleportMapCanvas">
          <img id="teleportMapImage" src="/shop/assets/teleport/scum-map-ultra.webp?v=202611132110" alt="SCUM 超清游戏地图" draggable="false">
          <div class="teleport-map-grid" id="teleportMapGrid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="teleport-map-markers" id="teleportMapMarkers"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="teleport-map-meta">
        <p class="teleport-map-status" id="teleportMapStatus">登录后读取本人、小队与载具位置</p>
        <p class="teleport-map-warning" id="teleportMapWarning" hidden></p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="teleport-action-panel" aria-label="商城安全传送">
      <div class="teleport-action-summary">
        <strong id="teleportActionStatus">登录后读取传送额度</strong>
        <span id="teleportActionQuota">今日可用次数：—</span>
        <span id="teleportActionPrice">本次价格：—</span>
      </div>
      <form id="teleportActionForm">
        <fieldset class="teleport-mode-picker" aria-label="传送方式">
          <legend>传送方式</legend>
          <button class="teleport-mode-option active" type="button" data-teleport-mode="character" aria-pressed="true"><strong>角色传送</strong><small>CHARACTER</small></button>
          <button class="teleport-mode-option" type="button" data-teleport-mode="vehicle" aria-pressed="false"><strong>载具传送</strong><small>仅实时加载载具</small></button>
        </fieldset>
        <input id="teleportTargetType" type="hidden">
        <input id="teleportTargetId" type="hidden">
        <input id="teleportDestinationId" type="hidden">
        <div class="teleport-selected-target" id="teleportSelectedTarget" aria-live="polite">
          <span data-teleport-icon="target" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div><small>当前目标</small><strong id="teleportSelectedTargetName">未选择传送目标</strong><p id="teleportSelectedTargetMeta">—</p></div>
          <button class="button ghost" id="teleportClearTarget" type="button" hidden>取消</button>
        </div>
        <div class="teleport-selected-target teleport-selected-destination" id="teleportSelectedDestination" aria-live="polite" hidden>
          <span data-teleport-icon="flag" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div><small>地图目的地</small><strong id="teleportSelectedDestinationName">请选择固定位置、领地旗、本人或在线队友</strong><p id="teleportSelectedDestinationMeta">—</p></div>
          <button class="button ghost" id="teleportClearDestination" type="button" hidden>取消</button>
        </div>
        <button class="button primary" id="teleportExecute" type="submit" disabled>计算距离与费用</button>
        <button class="button ghost" id="teleportActionRefresh" type="button">刷新目标与额度</button>
      </form>
      <div class="teleport-safety-rules" aria-label="传送使用规则"><strong>使用规则</strong><ul><li>角色与载具传送分别计算每日可用次数；会员赠送次数和传送折扣会分别应用到两类传送。</li><li>固定价格按次扣款；距离计价按起点到目的地的水平距离计算，不足1公里按1公里计费。</li><li>角色只能前往地图中的授权目标，包括管理员启用的固定位置；部分动态目标可能使用24小时内最后位置；载具必须实时加载，并选择固定位置、领地旗、本人或在线队友作为目的地。</li><li>载具传送受个人间隔限制；明确执行失败会退回本次扣款，结果暂时无法确认时请等待客服核查。</li></ul></div>
      <p class="teleport-action-note" id="teleportActionNote">传送执行只提交服务端生成的安全目标，不提交 SteamID、坐标或原始游戏命令。</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
